HB0037 Expulsion for possession of a deadly weapon.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Harshman and Heiner and Senator(s)
Schuler
AN ACT relating to education; allowing a school district board of trustees to
expel a student from public school for possession of a deadly weapon for longer
than a year as specified; and providing for an effective date.
12/13/2024 Bill Number Assigned
